#! ia 1.0

@law canon-a14-work-placement
  meaning
    says "Work records (plans, milestones, tasks, decisions and specs) never sit inside a vocabulary system's folder."
    answers "Where may plans, milestones, tasks, decisions and specs be authored relative to vocabulary system folders?"
  governance
    severity advisory
    requires "Author plans, milestones, tasks, decisions and specs outside every vocabulary system's folder under .ia/src/systems/."
  subject
    subject-word spec
  relationships
    cites @agent public-work-system-steward
